SUMMARY:(1) Ceres hides a mag 11.8 star
DESCRIPTION:(1) Ceres hides a magnitude 11.8 star\, seen from Bareilly.\nYo
 u are inside the path\, 288 km from its centre line: the star vanishes for
  up to 34.3 s.\nClosest approach 04:44:00 IST\, give or take 1 s. The star
  is 61° up in the E · dark sky.\nIt fades 0.1 magnitudes for up to 42.3 
 s on the centre line\, and the path is 939 km wide\, give or take 19 km.\n
 Finder chart\, the map and the path as KML: https://occult.alokm.com/aster
 oids-2026-09#2026-09-28-1-ceres-708160
